---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../data/siteMeta';
---

<section class="client-guides-section" id="clients">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
      <div class="section-num">04 / CLIENT SETUP & WORKFLOW</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">全平台客户端配置流程说明</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        按操作系统选择合规客户端，从注册购买到导入订阅连接只需三步。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Steps Grid -->
    <div class="workflow-steps grid-box">
      <div class="grid-header">
        <div class="badge">GETTING STARTED WORKFLOW</div>
        <div>简单 3 步开启连接</div>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-body">
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">STEP 01</div>
          <h3 class="step-title">开通订阅套餐</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">
            前往<a href={SITE_CONFIG.buyUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener">官方订阅平台</a>注册账号，选择基础版、专线版、旗舰版或一次性流量包并完成支付。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">STEP 02</div>
          <h3 class="step-title">获取订阅链接</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">
            在订阅控制台找到“快速导入”或“复制订阅链接（URL）”，将专属的 Token 链接复制到剪贴板。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <div class="step-num">STEP 03</div>
          <h3 class="step-title">导入客户端并连接</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">
            打开 ClashParty、Shadowrocket 或 Stash 软件，贴入订阅 URL 完成节点拉取，开启“规则模式（Rule）”即可畅游。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Multi-platform Client Cards -->
    <div class="platform-grid">
      <div class="platform-card grid-box">
        <div class="grid-header">
          <div class="badge">WINDOWS</div>
        </div>
        <div class="platform-body">
          <h4 class="platform-name">ClashParty / Clash Verge</h4>
          <p class="platform-desc">适用于 Windows 10/11 64位系统。支持图形化策略组切换与 TUN 虚拟网卡模式。</p>
          <ul class="platform-checklist">
            <li>✓ 开启 System Proxy 系统代理</li>
            <li>✓ 勾选 Rule 规则分流模式</li>
            <li>✓ 开启 Windows 自动时间同步</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="platform-card grid-box">
        <div class="grid-header">
          <div class="badge">ANDROID</div>
        </div>
        <div class="platform-body">
          <h4 class="platform-name">Clash Meta / Surfboard</h4>
          <p class="platform-desc">支持各种 Android 手机与平板。原生适配 VpnService 系统服务。</p>
          <ul class="platform-checklist">
            <li>✓ 允许创建系统 VPN 连接</li>
            <li>✓ 设置应用“无限制”后台运行</li>
            <li>✓ 定期拉取最新分流规则</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="platform-card grid-box">
        <div class="grid-header">
          <div class="badge">IOS / MACOS</div>
        </div>
        <div class="platform-body">
          <h4 class="platform-name">Shadowrocket / Stash</h4>
          <p class="platform-desc">iOS 平台高口碑客户端。支持二维码扫描配置与规则分流。</p>
          <ul class="platform-checklist">
            <li>✓ 使用非大陆区 Apple ID 获取</li>
            <li>✓ 允许添加 VPN 节点配置</li>
            <li>✓ 开启按需连接（On-Demand）</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.client-guides-section {
  padding: 4rem 0;
}

.workflow-steps {
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.steps-body {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 2rem;
  padding: 2rem;
}

.step-num {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-accent-green);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.step-title {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-warm-white);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.step-desc {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-silver);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.platform-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.platform-body {
  padding: 1.5rem;
}

.platform-name {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-warm-white);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.platform-desc {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: var(--color-silver);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.platform-checklist {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #D1D5DB;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .steps-body {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .platform-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
